<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-KRAJICECK FINED FOR SHUNNING PRESS CONFERENCE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KRAJICECK FINED FOR SHUNNING PRESS CONFERENCE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wimbledon champion Richard Krajicek was fined $2,000 for refusing to attend a post-match press conference after his defeat to Australian Patrick Rafter at the French Open on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;Richard Krajicek has refused to attend the press conference. He has accepted to pay the $2,000 fine,&quot; organisers said.</p>
<p>The Dutchman, seeded sixth, lost the third round tie 6-3 4-6 6-4 6-2.</p>
</text>
